Adventurer,

The *Wild Blood* ( https://albiononline.com/update/wild-blood ) update laun=
ches *October 16* , and at its heart is a brand-new weapon line: *Shapeshif=
ter Weapons*. In this Dev Talk, Game Director Robin Henkys and Combat Desig=
ner Michael Schwahn take an in-depth look at this significant expansion to =
Albion=E2=80=99s =E2=80=98you are what you wear=E2=80=99 system.

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3D6hs6LuSipEw )

Or click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/shapeshifter-close-up ) for=
 a written summary.

Along with Shapeshifter Weapons, you=E2=80=99ll be able to *track fantastic=
al creatures* , create *Awakened Weapons* , enjoy your *reworked Personal I=
slands* , and much more when Wild Blood arrives on *Monday, October 16* ( h=
ttps://albiononline.com/update/wild-blood ). So mark the date and get ready=
 to check out this new and improved content!

( https://albiononline.com/news/island-move-2023 )

Last Chance to Move Your Island
-------------------------------

And with the changes coming to islands, now is your *last chance* to move y=
ours to your favored location! The move period closes with the update relea=
se, so don=E2=80=99t miss out. For more information, click here:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/news/island-move-2023 )

